  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  enabled: 1
  lines:
  - '* I could explain what the\n  <color=#FFFF00FF>hospital system</color> is about...'
  - '* But you guys don''t seem\n  like the kind of people that\n  would use it.'
  - '* Yeah...^05 something about you\n  screams "autoheal when\n  knocked out..."'
  - '* I imagine the only thing of\n  use would be the healer,^05\n  who can heal concussions.'
  - '* But if he''s gone,^05 then\n  you''d just have to deal\n  with it.'
  sounds:
  - snd_text
  - snd_text
  - snd_text
  - snd_text
  - snd_text
  speed: 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
  portraits:
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  remarks: []
  secondaryLines: 0
  lines2:
  - '* Hey man,^05 no judging!'
  - '* What if I judged YOUR\n  religion?'
  - '* Dude,^05 if you''re doing\n  stuff like sacrifices,^05\n  you''re in a cult.'
  - '* You aren''t doing doing\n  sacrifices,^05 right?'
  - '* ...'
  sounds2:
  - snd_text
  - snd_text
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_txtsus
  - snd_text
  speed2: 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
  portraits2:
  - 
  - 
  - su_annoyed
  - su_side_sweat
  - 
  remarks2: []
